    "video_script": "Six goals at the 2018 World Cup. One Golden Boot. England still finished fourth. Harry Kane scored twice against Tunisia, then a hat-trick against Panama. Three of his six goals were penalties. His only knockout goal was a penalty against Colombia. Mbappé, Ronaldo and Lukaku all finished on four. England lost the semi-final to Croatia in extra time, then lost the third-place game to Belgium. Does a Golden Boot make up for fourth place?",
